This repository builds the dflow CLI and the dflow-server API. It does not
rebuild every image the chart can run. Until dFlow publishes replacements, the
chart still pulls these published upstream images:

- ghcr.io/epinio/dex (Dex, with PKCE)
- ghcr.io/epinio/epinio-unpacker
- ghcr.io/epinio/kaniko

Application workloads are deployed with charts derived from the Epinio
helm-charts releases (epinio-application 0.1.26, the Gateway API variant
0.1.26, and the stateful variant 0.1.24). The rebranded archives are in
packages/helm-chart/app-charts and are copied into the server image.
